Suggested attribution:
  Zhejian Zhou, Tianyi Zhou, Robin Jia, Jonathan May. "How Language Models
  Process Negation" (ICML 2026), negation prompt dataset, CC BY 4.0.

Provenance: the concept pairs were curated by the authors and expanded with
OpenAI gpt-4; the multiple gold answers per prompt were generated with OpenAI
gpt-4o (see the paper's appendix on dataset curation). Use of model-generated
content may additionally be subject to the generating provider's terms.

